{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gqWoP4frtE1794415380.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本聯賽盃八強首回合，鹿島鹿角作客3-2反勝橫濱水手。</p><p></p><p>紅衫的鹿角，早段失12碼，經VAR協助，球證判千田海人犯規。二田理央操刀，為水手20分鐘開紀錄。</p><p></p><p>5分鐘後的界外球，宮市亮門市射入，拉開2-0。但這位入球功臣30分鐘侵犯對手，VAR介入，球證由黃轉紅，直接以紅牌趕他出場。</p><p></p><p>踢多一人的鹿角，先由鈴木優磨，半場補時6分鐘，以頭槌追近。65分鐘，禁區一輪混戰，柴崎岳勁射入網，追平2-2。</p><p></p><p>鈴木優磨到82分鐘入今場第二球，協助鹿角反勝3-2，周日返主場踢次回合。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:02:29.335380+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:07:30.155907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T17:55:45.986393+00:00","content_hash":"a1ec2326e520c86100e5d8addf34b137379756898b8c1fa7f9c9c67787d5c621","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:02:29.335380+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}